WEBVTT

00:01:59.993 --> 00:02:02.638
va harakatlanishga bog'liq
muammolarni yuzaga keltiradi.

00:02:02.638 --> 00:02:05.945
Ular buyrak va ichaklarga kirib, 
qorin og'rig'iga,

00:02:05.945 --> 00:02:10.735
so'ngra miyaga kirib, bosh og'rig'i va 
hatto ongni xiralashishiga sabab bo'ladi.

00:02:10.735 --> 00:02:14.348
Sil kasalligi odatda vazn yo'qotish, 
qonli quruq yo'tal va

00:02:14.348 --> 00:02:19.088
kulrang teri rangi kabi 
alomatlar bilan tavsiflanadi.

00:02:19.088 --> 00:02:23.341
Bemorlarning qo'rqinchli tashqi ko'rinishi
sabab qirolicha Viktoriya davrida

00:02:23.341 --> 00:02:25.749
Angliyada sil kasalligi
"oq vabo" nomini olgan.

00:02:25.749 --> 00:02:29.785
O'sha paytlarda sil kasalligi 
"romantiklar kasalligi"

00:02:29.785 --> 00:02:33.803
deb ham yuritilgan, chunki 
u bilan, asosan, immuniteti zaif